infinite-patch 1
# Neo-Classical Felt Piano Harmonic Synth
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 0.5
  i steps 16
  i note0 60
  i note1 60
  i note2 67
  i note3 64
  i note4 60
  i note5 67
  i note6 65
  i note7 67
  i note8 57
  i note9 57
  i note10 64
